# RELEASE-027: fail-closed dotenv policy. One general rule covers every depth --
# the reviewed root-only list left apps/web/.env.production, .envrc, and
# .env.secrets committable -- and exactly the two template shapes are re-included.
# scripts/ignore-policy.test.mjs proves this behaviorally with git check-ignore.
